        {
          "resource_id": "monster_action",
          "stats": {
            "action_name": {
              "value": "Fetters of Debt"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "(auditory, curse, linguistic, mental, occult)\n\nFrequency: 1/minute\n\nThe aurosrath bellows a plea for gold, remarking that their foes are overladen. Creatures in a 15-foot emanation must succeed at a DC 19 Will save or become encumbered for 1 minute. The creature is aware that it can immediately end the condition by giving the aurosrath items or treasure worth at least 20 gp. Handing a held item to the aurosrath is a single Interact action. If the aurosrath's hands are full, the item falls in their space, but the condition still ends."
            },
